\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Weary souls that wander wide
\par From the central point of bliss,
\par Turn to Jesus crucified,
\par Fly to those dear wounds of His:
\par Sink into the cleansing flood;
\par Rise into the life of God.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Find in Christ the way of peace,
\par Peace unspeakable, unknown,
\par By His pain He gives you ease,
\par Life by His expiring groan:
\par Rise, exalted by His fall;
\par Find in Christ your all in all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O believe the record true:
\par God to you His Son hath given,
\par Ye may now be happy too,
\par Find on earth the life of heaven,
\par Live the life of heaven above,
\par All the life of glorious love.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

